    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH8x4422-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:38:36.022+09:00">In general, although all people posses [human] nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:39:01.033+09:00">their heart-minds have no fixed inclinations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:39:28.92+09:00">[which insteado] depend on [external] things to arise,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:39:42.392+09:00">depend on gratification to take action,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:40:00.009+09:00">and depend upon practices to become fixed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:40:32.311+09:00">The vital energies of joy, anger, grief and sorrow</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:40:43.499+09:00">are [human nature];</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:40:59.71+09:00">once they manifest externally, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:41:08.418+09:00">things take hold of them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:41:35.957+09:00">[Human] nature comes via mandate,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:41:54.283+09:00">and [this] mandate is sent down from Heaven.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:42:22.762+09:00">The Way begins with the affections,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:42:33.616+09:00">and the affections are born of [human] nature.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:50:40.021+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:50:46.67+09:00">[The Way's] beginnings are close to the affections</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:51:41.571+09:00">while its finalities are close to propriety.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:52:20.673+09:00">Those who know the affections can bring it forth, </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:52:29.274+09:00">while those who knowpropriety can instill it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:52:42.942+09:00">Liking and disliking </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:52:54.27+09:00">belong to [human] nature;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:53:04.716+09:00">theobjects of that liking or disliking</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:53:11.056+09:00">are [external] things. </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:53:46.483+09:00">Approval</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:53:54.075+09:00">anddisapproval </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:54:02.877+09:00">belong to [human] nature; </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:54:19.288+09:00">the objects of that approval ordisapproval </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH8x4422_CHANT_001-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T22:56:59.815+09:00">are a matter of cultivation.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
